{"id":"n37173-1-7","stage":3,"title":"난로 · 火炉","scene":"居住与环境","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n37173-1-7-1","ko":"아, 눈에 젖어서 그런지 춥네.","zh":"啊，可能被雪弄湿了，真冷。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아,","meaning":"咦","explanation":"아：咦","readings":[{"term":"아","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16247","senseId":"1","lemma":"아","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"눈에","meaning":"雪","explanation":"눈：雪；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"눈","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20198","senseId":"1","lemma":"눈","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"젖어서","meaning":"沾湿，浸湿，润湿","explanation":"젖다：沾湿，浸湿，润湿；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"젖다","audio":"/audio/5f61a84f921197b6dee3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64729","senseId":"1","lemma":"젖다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"그런지","meaning":"那样","explanation":"그렇다：那样；ㄴ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"그렇다","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61178","senseId":"1","lemma":"그렇다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"춥네.","meaning":"冷","explanation":"춥다：冷；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"춥다","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72146","senseId":"1","lemma":"춥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d6ce479be9ddc9b7","term":"아","zh":"咦","audio":"/audio/d6ce479be9ddc9b7de97.mp3","entryId":"16247","definition":"感到惊讶、慌张、焦急、急促时发出的声音。","pronunciation":["아"]},{"id":"ab1b14816087979d","term":"눈","zh":"雪","audio":"/audio/ab1b14816087979d2143.mp3","entryId":"20198","definition":"空气中的水气结冰后掉到地面后形成的白色棉花状小冰块。","pronunciation":["눈ː"]},{"id":"5f61a84f921197b6","term":"젖다","zh":"沾湿，浸湿，润湿","audio":"/audio/5f61a84f921197b6dee3.mp3","entryId":"64729","definition":"液体渗入，变得潮湿。","pronunciation":["젇따"]},{"id":"f7c6efa694aaef95","term":"그렇다","zh":"那样","audio":"/audio/f7c6efa694aaef9559bd.mp3","entryId":"61178","definition":"表示状态、样子、性质等与此相同。","pronunciation":["그러타"]},{"id":"7c651efb56d12a65","term":"춥다","zh":"冷","audio":"/audio/7c651efb56d12a6540a4.mp3","entryId":"72146","definition":"身体感觉到的气温低。","pronunciation":["춥따"]}],"audio":"/audio/3f5a4af91afb3bdeccb3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n37173-1-7-2","ko":"응. 빨리 안으로 들어가서 난로에 몸을 말리자.","zh":"嗯，快进去在炉边烤干身子吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"응.","meaning":"是，行","explanation":"응：是，行","readings":[{"term":"응","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30205","senseId":"2","lemma":"응","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빨리","meaning":"快，赶快","explanation":"빨리：快，赶快","readings":[{"term":"빨리","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57305","senseId":"1","lemma":"빨리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안으로","meaning":"里，里面","explanation":"안：里，里面；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74890","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"들어가서","meaning":"进，进去","explanation":"들어가다：进，进去；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"난로에","meaning":"火炉，炉子","explanation":"난로：火炉，炉子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"난로","audio":"/audio/a55df9ca3a3fa7670321.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37173","senseId":"1","lemma":"난로","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몸을","meaning":"身体，身子","explanation":"몸：身体，身子；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"몸","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74138","senseId":"1","lemma":"몸","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"말리자.","meaning":"晾干，晒干，风干","explanation":"말리다：晾干，晒干，风干；자：非敬语提议句末：“一起……吧”。","readings":[{"term":"말리다","audio":"/audio/887a3759846ff90f5fc9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14630","senseId":"1","lemma":"말리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"107dd01c3d38a368","term":"응","zh":"是，行","audio":"/audio/107dd01c3d38a368ad44.mp3","entryId":"30205","definition":"用于肯定回答对方所提出的问题或命令等。","pronunciation":["응"]},{"id":"a5443c04aa0fdc08","term":"빨리","zh":"快，赶快","audio":"/audio/a5443c04aa0fdc08a00a.mp3","entryId":"57305","definition":"花费的时间不长地。","pronunciation":["빨리"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"里，里面","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"74890","definition":"从某物体或空间的周围向着中间的方向；或指那样的部分。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"进，进去","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"由外往里去。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]},{"id":"a55df9ca3a3fa767","term":"난로","zh":"火炉，炉子","audio":"/audio/a55df9ca3a3fa7670321.mp3","entryId":"37173","definition":"以煤气、石油、木柴等作为燃料或利用电来给屋里供暖的器具。","pronunciation":["날ː로"]},{"id":"955149b012635be1","term":"몸","zh":"身体，身子","audio":"/audio/955149b012635be1833c.mp3","entryId":"74138","definition":"指从头到脚组成人或动物形象的整体；或指其状态。","pronunciation":["몸"]},{"id":"887a3759846ff90f","term":"말리다","zh":"晾干，晒干，风干","audio":"/audio/887a3759846ff90f5fc9.mp3","entryId":"14630","definition":"使水分全部蒸发而消失。","pronunciation":["말리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/46dd2811e7857aaeb07f.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.637,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=37173","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":91,"sequenceScore":2.4637,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["啊，可能被雪弄湿了，真冷。","嗯，快进去在炉边烤干身子吧。","你为什么喜欢爬山呢？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["啊，可能被雪弄湿了，真冷。","嗯，快进去在炉边烤干身子吧。","你为什么喜欢爬山呢？"],"answer":1}]}
